---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { growthPhases } from "../data/brand";
import { withBase } from "../utils/base-path";
---
<BaseLayout><Header/><main id="main">
<section class="hero section"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Premium at-home beauty technology</p><img class="hero-logo" src={withBase("brand/generated/cyph1-wordmark-metallic.svg")} alt="CYPH/1" width="657" height="165"/><h1>Target the growth.</h1><p class="lede">A new approach to at-home IPL, informed by the rhythm of the hair-growth cycle. Precision, consistency and considered design—coming soon.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#early-access">Join early access</a><a class="text-link" href="#cycle">Discover the cycle <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><figure class="product-teaser"><span class="teaser-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src={withBase("brand/teaser/cyph1-product-direction-v2.webp")} alt="Abstract product-direction silhouette with a visible light-treatment aperture" width="900" height="1350"/><figcaption><span>Product direction</span>Final design subject to change</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="brand-story section" aria-labelledby="brand-heading"><div class="container split-heading"><p class="section-index">01 / The name</p><div class="name-content"><h2 id="brand-heading">Cycle.<br/>Phase.<br/><em>One.</em></h2><div class="name-cycle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cycle-object"><div class="cycle-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="cycle-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="phase-core"><span>01</span><strong>ANAGEN</strong><small>ACTIVE GROWTH</small></div><span class="orbit-label label-cycle">CYCLE</span><span class="orbit-label label-phase">PHASE</span><span class="orbit-label label-one">ONE</span></div></div><p class="name-intro">CYPH/1 begins with a simple principle: hair does not grow all at once. It moves through a repeating cycle, and consistency matters.</p></div></div><div class="container word-breakdown" aria-label="The meaning of CYPH/1"><div><strong>CY</strong><span>Cycle</span></div><div><strong>PH</strong><span>Phase</span></div><div><strong>/1</strong><span>One</span></div></div></section>
<section class="cycle-section section" id="cycle" aria-labelledby="cycle-heading"><div class="container section-intro"><p class="section-index">02 / The science</p><div><h2 id="cycle-heading">Growth moves<br/>in phases.</h2><p>IPL treatment is repeated over time so treatment can coincide with hairs entering active growth. The cycle has four stages.</p></div></div><ol class="container phase-grid">{growthPhases.map((phase) => <li class:list={{active:phase.active}}><span>{phase.number}</span><h3>{phase.name}</h3><p>{phase.label}</p>{phase.active && <small>Phase one</small>}</li>)}</ol><div class="container science-note"><p><strong>A considered routine, not a shortcut.</strong> No home IPL device can identify the growth phase of an individual hair. Repeated treatments work across the natural cycle.</p></div></section>
<section class="principles section" id="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-heading"><div class="container section-intro"><p class="section-index">03 / Our approach</p><div><h2 id="principles-heading">Built around<br/>what matters.</h2><p>We are developing CYPH/1 around three principles. Product details will be published only when they are verified.</p></div></div><div class="container principle-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Precision</h3><p>Technology chosen with purpose, explained with clarity and without inflated claims.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Consistency</h3><p>A considered experience designed around a repeatable at-home routine.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Comfort</h3><p>Thoughtful product selection focused on a controlled, approachable experience.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="early-access section" id="early-access" aria-labelledby="access-heading"><div class="container access-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">The first 100</p><h2 id="access-heading">Be first in<br/>the cycle.</h2></div><div class="access-copy"><p>Join the CYPH/1 early-access list for product development updates and launch information.</p><form class="signup-form" aria-describedby="signup-note"><label for="email">Email address</label><div class="input-row"><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.co.uk" required/><button class="button" type="button" aria-describedby="signup-note">Join soon</button></div><p id="signup-note" class="form-note">Early-access registration will open shortly. No payment or pre-order.</p></form></div></div></section>
</main><Footer/></BaseLayout>

